{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261126/photo/bkn-20261126175704933-1126_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261126175704\"/><p>煉油廠起火。</p><p>泰國首都曼谷東部一個大型煉油廠周四（26日）下午近3時爆炸起火，暫未接獲傷亡報告。煉油廠所屬的公司表示，火勢已經受控，但呼籲周邊居民繼續撤離。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T10:24:01.896551+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":86,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T09:57:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T12:37:29.597178+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T10:17:20.917741+00:00","content_hash":"89e574109fce7440d57f7004e7f548a69f121e05e3f1b287ff5408ecfcbaeaa4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}